flowchart TD
    START([START]) --> planner[planner<br/>계획 생성]
    planner -->|success| plan_review[plan_review<br/>interrupt로 승인/수정 요청]
    planner -->|error| finalizer[finalizer<br/>최종 답변 생성]

    plan_review -->|approved| executor[executor<br/>현재 PlanStep 실행]
    plan_review -->|feedback| plan_editor[plan_editor<br/>피드백 반영해 계획 재작성]

    plan_editor -->|success| plan_review
    plan_editor -->|error| finalizer

    executor -->|success| checker[checker<br/>continue / replan / finish 판단]
    executor -->|failed and<br/>replan_count < MAX_REPLANS| replanner[replanner<br/>남은 계획 수정]
    executor -->|failed and<br/>replan_count >= MAX_REPLANS| finalizer

    checker -->|continue| executor
    checker -->|replan| replanner
    checker -->|finish| finalizer

    replanner -->|success| executor
    replanner -->|error or<br/>replan limit exceeded| finalizer

    finalizer --> END([END])